{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！橋本です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日今日と撮影でした〜☆\n昨日は悪天候でどうなることかと思ったけど\n無事に終了〜ヾ(^▽^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来上がりが楽しみ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこ観て頂けましたか？\nあみ、ほんと面白すぎた〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／\n(^-^)　割ってみる？\n＼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／\nd=(^o^)=b　みる〜！\n＼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今後こんなやり取りが\nあみとあみ推しの間で流行るんだろうなぁ♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなあみと、七瀬と\n昨日今日とホテル同室ですっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わらけたわらけた〜〜(o^_^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥が寂しいって昨日から私たちの部屋に入り浸りです。かわいい♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにあみはカボチャだったけど\n私は婦警さんでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左折禁止！ペイッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-179.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花嫁まいまいを保護する警官橋本の図。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい可愛すぎだろおぉぉ(〃▽〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はこれにて♪♪\nおやすみなさーい☆"}],"source":"archive"}